  "details": "Like all games, VRchat has bugs every now and again and often times simply leaving and joining an instance again solves any avatar or safety issue. Having an official version of this feature would help solve these issues as well as the bug where turning off safe mode changes to the minimum safety mode instead of your custom safety mode. That way players who don’t have the privilege of fast internet won’t have to sit and wait for every single avatar to load fully before trying to change their safety settings.",
